    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "WISHLIST NOW!                                                                        \u2191\u2191<br><br>And SUBSCRIBE HERE for the closed demo!<br><br><br><br>When a defective clone, destined for military disposal due to his &quot;abnormality,&quot; is about to be recycled, he rebels against the oppressive regime that created him and embarks on a daring journey of self-discovery. With each step, he plunges deeper into a world filled with danger, emotion, and untold secrets, determined to uncover the truth behind his existence and face the true enemy lurking in the shadows.<br><br>His journey takes a pivotal turn when he encounters an ancient extraterrestrial being\u2014an entity of immense wisdom, yet burdened by a haunting past. Together, they must navigate their inner darkness and confront their intertwined fates. Will they make the right choices to find their way home?<br><br>Science fiction, action, and strategy converge in this epic adventure that blends Three-Lane Reverse Tower Defense with On-Rails First Person Shooter modes.<br><br><i>&quot;It's like a fascinating mixture of StarCraft and Plants Vs. Zombies. I can't wait to see where this story leads!&quot;</i><br><br>Join this beautifully crafted and thrilling experience, created by the seasoned solo developer Ale Navarro.<br><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><strong>Lead a Squad:</strong> Command over twenty dynamic units, crafting diverse strategies to overcome adversaries.<br><br><strong>In-Game Store:</strong> Purchase and upgrade skills using hard-earned (in-game) currency.<br><br><strong>Underground Depot:</strong> Craft and unleash powerful technologies.<br><br><strong>Epic Odyssey:</strong> Journey through 50+ exhilarating levels across various planets, uncovering secrets and facing formidable foes.<br><br><strong>Narrative Depth:</strong> Immerse yourself in a powerful story that evokes empathy and empowerment.<br><br><strong>Original Soundtrack:</strong> Enjoy a captivating soundtrack curated by Ale Navarro in collaboration with emerging musicians.<br><br><strong>Pranic Garden:</strong> Nurture extraterrestrial flora and fauna in your unique garden.<br><br><strong>Dynamic Weather:</strong> Experience weather systems that alter gameplay and ambiance.<br><br><strong>Strategic Command Center:</strong> Influence the narrative with every decision.<br><br><strong>Uncover Secrets:</strong> Discover countless exciting secrets throughout the game.<br><br>Prepare for the journey of a lifetime\u2014there's no turning back!",
    "about_the_game": "WISHLIST NOW!                                                                        \u2191\u2191<br><br>And SUBSCRIBE HERE for the closed demo!<br><br><br><br>When a defective clone, destined for military disposal due to his &quot;abnormality,&quot; is about to be recycled, he rebels against the oppressive regime that created him and embarks on a daring journey of self-discovery. With each step, he plunges deeper into a world filled with danger, emotion, and untold secrets, determined to uncover the truth behind his existence and face the true enemy lurking in the shadows.<br><br>His journey takes a pivotal turn when he encounters an ancient extraterrestrial being\u2014an entity of immense wisdom, yet burdened by a haunting past. Together, they must navigate their inner darkness and confront their intertwined fates. Will they make the right choices to find their way home?<br><br>Science fiction, action, and strategy converge in this epic adventure that blends Three-Lane Reverse Tower Defense with On-Rails First Person Shooter modes.<br><br><i>&quot;It's like a fascinating mixture of StarCraft and Plants Vs. Zombies. I can't wait to see where this story leads!&quot;</i><br><br>Join this beautifully crafted and thrilling experience, created by the seasoned solo developer Ale Navarro.<br><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><strong>Lead a Squad:</strong> Command over twenty dynamic units, crafting diverse strategies to overcome adversaries.<br><br><strong>In-Game Store:</strong> Purchase and upgrade skills using hard-earned (in-game) currency.<br><br><strong>Underground Depot:</strong> Craft and unleash powerful technologies.<br><br><strong>Epic Odyssey:</strong> Journey through 50+ exhilarating levels across various planets, uncovering secrets and facing formidable foes.<br><br><strong>Narrative Depth:</strong> Immerse yourself in a powerful story that evokes empathy and empowerment.<br><br><strong>Original Soundtrack:</strong> Enjoy a captivating soundtrack curated by Ale Navarro in collaboration with emerging musicians.<br><br><strong>Pranic Garden:</strong> Nurture extraterrestrial flora and fauna in your unique garden.<br><br><strong>Dynamic Weather:</strong> Experience weather systems that alter gameplay and ambiance.<br><br><strong>Strategic Command Center:</strong> Influence the narrative with every decision.<br><br><strong>Uncover Secrets:</strong> Discover countless exciting secrets throughout the game.<br><br>Prepare for the journey of a lifetime\u2014there's no turning back!",
    "short_description": "&quot;SYNCHRONIZERS: Undead Marines&quot; blends high-quality Three-Lane Tower Defense with Reverse Tower Defense gameplay. Command dynamic units in a thrilling narrative reminiscent of a StarCraft and Plants Vs. Zombies fusion! Your choices will forge the path to victory\u2014or defeat.",
